<section id="faq" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-faq;"><div class="faq u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="faq__header"><h2 class="u-text-headings-large">Pirms sÄc, iespÄ“jams, vÄ“lies uzzinÄt vairÄk.</h2></div><div class="faq__body"><div class="faq-categories"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-large faq-category" open="" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style="display:none;"><div class="u-text-headings-small details__title"></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="faq-items"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" open="" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Cik Ätri var izgatavot venÄ«rus?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Ja visi zobi ir veseli, venÄ«rus var izgatavot un uzstÄdÄ«t pat 7 dienu laikÄ.</p><p><br></p><p>TomÄ“r jÄÅ†em vÄ“rÄ gan nepiecieÅ¡amais venÄ«ru skaits, gan iespÄ“ja saplÄnot vizÄ«tes pie Ärsta. PraksÄ“ pilna zobu rindas uzlaboÅ¡ana ar venÄ«riem aizÅ†em mÄ“nesi lÄ«dz pusotram jeb 4 vizÄ«tes.</p><p><br></p><ul class="list-bullet"><li class="" style="" value="1">PirmajÄ vizÄ«tÄ“ izzinÄm Tavas vÄ“lmes un veicam daÅ¾Ädus izmeklÄ“jumus, uz kuru bÄzes varÄ“sim plÄnot venÄ«ru formu, krÄsu un nepiecieÅ¡amo skaitu.</li><li class="" style="" value="2">OtrajÄ vizÄ«te prezentÄ“jam digitÄlo smaida dizainu, kas Ä¼auj jau pirms jebkÄdu manipulÄciju veikÅ¡anas redzÄ“t jauno smaidu, kÄ arÄ« iepazÄ«stinÄm ar pilnu ÄrstÄ“Å¡anas plÄnu, visÄm izmaksÄm un paredzamajiem termiÅ†iem.</li><li class="" style="" value="3">TreÅ¡Ä vizÄ«te ir sagatavoÅ¡anÄs venÄ«ru uzlikÅ¡anai. VizÄ«tes laikÄ zobi tiek viegli nopulÄ“ti, nevis slÄ«pÄ“ti.</li><li class="" style="" value="4">CeturtÄ vizÄ«te — venÄ«ru uzlikÅ¡ana.</li></ul><p><br></p><p>* VenÄ«ru gatavoÅ¡ana ir roku darbs, tÄdÄ“Ä¼ izgatavoÅ¡anas laiks var atÅ¡Ä·irties atkarÄ«bÄ no nepiecieÅ¡amÄ venÄ«ru skaita!</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.1s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Vai var uzlabot tikai vienu zobu ar venÄ«ra palÄ«dzÄ«bu?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>JÄ, protams, ja zobs ir kÄ¼uvis tumÅ¡Äks vai ir traumÄ“ts, mÄ“s varam uzstÄdÄ«t venÄ«ru tikai vienam zobam.</p><p><br></p><p>PraksÄ“ nereti pietiek ar daÅ¾iem venÄ«riem, lai smaids pilnÄ«bÄ mainÄ«tos un tu izskatÄ«tos un justos pÄrliecinÄtÄk par sevi!</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.2s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Cik izmaksÄ viens venÄ«rs?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5